---
// The top of the landing page. The heading is the old hand-kept page's;
// the intro is the final one from 14 Nov 2026 (blind-read).
---

<header class="hero">
  <svg class="mark" viewBox="0 0 512 512" aria-hidden="true">
    <rect width="512" height="512" rx="104" fill="#C47B6A" opacity=".14"></rect>
    <path d="M256 96c-36 0-66 54-66 128 0 56 20 102 66 148 46-46 66-92 66-148 0-74-30-128-66-128z" fill="#C47B6A"></path>
    <path d="M256 150c-18 0-33 37-33 83 0 35 11 64 33 91 22-27 33-56 33-91 0-46-15-83-33-83z" fill="#A85040"></path>
  </svg>
  <h1>Open<span class="hearth">Hearth</span></h1>
  <p class="tagline">Calm, private tools for the life of a home.</p>
  <p class="lede">Free apps for family life. Open any of them in your browser, on a phone or a computer. What you save stays on your device unless you choose to share it. No accounts, no ads.</p>
  <div class="values">
    <span class="chip">Local-first</span>
    <span class="chip">No ads, no tracking</span>
    <span class="chip">No account needed</span>
    <span class="chip">Open source</span>
  </div>
</header>

<style>
  .hero {
    padding: 112px 0 40px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .mark {
    width: 60px;
    height: 60px;
    margin: 0 auto 22px;
    display: block;
    filter: drop-shadow(0 4px 10px rgba(168, 80, 64, 0.25));
  }
  h1 {
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 6vw, 4rem);
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin: 0 0 8px;
    line-height: 1.04;
  }
  .hearth {
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  .tagline {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: clamp(1.15rem, 2.6vw, 1.5rem);
    color: var(--text-sec);
    margin: 0 auto;
    max-width: 30ch;
  }
  .lede {
    margin: 26px auto 0;
    max-width: 56ch;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
  }
  .values {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 10px;
    justify-content: center;
    margin: 30px 0 0;
  }
  .chip {
    font-size: 0.86rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--accent);
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 7px 15px;
    box-shadow: var(--oh-shadow-xs);
  }
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .hero {
      padding: 92px 0 24px;
    }
  }
</style>
